Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P006.3b

Summary: MK7 opt-in one-shot 3-frame A hook after dry run and B-abort

Description: |
    P006.3b builds on hardware-tested P006.3a native pass-through.
    An optional native A pulse requires successful manual-A calibration,
    completed five-second dry run and separate physical B abort,
    and another 5s neutral-input countdown. Up to three frames,
    one pulse trial per game session, 350ms timeout and atomic
    cancellation. Never used by default or for online races.
    No autonomous racing or HID injection. Actuator UNTESTED on 3DS.
    P006.3a and P006.2 remain stable fallbacks.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
